{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/sundarpichai/status/2115115252690145519","id":"2115115252690145519","text":"Excited to share Genie 4 today our most realistic and interactive world model:\n\n- steer dynamic environments in real time, shaping events, camera angles, and actions\n\n- generate native audio matched to the world, from realistic background sounds to characters who can converse in real time!\n\n- simulate photorealistic scenes and real-world physics\n\n- create more coherent multi-step events through reasoning from Gemini\n\nWe've started to roll out as a research preview to trusted testers. Coming soon to Google AI Ultra subscribers in Project Genie and early access partners via the Gemini API and AI Studio.","raw_text":{"text":"Excited to share Genie 4 today our most realistic and interactive world model:\n\n- steer dynamic environments in real time, shaping events, camera angles, and actions\n\n- generate native audio matched to the world, from realistic background sounds to characters who can converse in real time!\n\n- simulate photorealistic scenes and real-world physics\n\n- create more coherent multi-step events through reasoning from Gemini\n\nWe've started to roll out as a research preview to trusted testers. Coming soon to Google AI Ultra subscribers in Project Genie and early access partners via the Gemini API and AI Studio.","display_text_range":[0,608],"facets":[{"type":"media","indices":[280,303],"id":"2115114850510897152","display":"pic.x.com/BFgQQH9KUb","original":"https://t.co/BFgQQH9KUb","replacement":"https://x.com/sundarpichai/status/2115115252690145519/video/1"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"sundarpichai","url":"https://x.com/sundarpichai","id":"14130366","followers":11923908,"following":200,"likes":1162,"media_count":399,"name":"Sundar Pichai","description":"CEO, Google and Alphabet","raw_description":{"text":"CEO, Google and Alphabet","facets":[]},"location":"","banner_url":"","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/